  "releaseNotes": "Exactly the same code as for the 8.0.0 package, but this one targets .NET9 instead of .NET8. \n        Both can of course be used by .NET10 projects never the less.\n        If you need support for MySQL but target .NET10, use this version over the 10.0.0 version, since the Palemo extension is still not .Net10 ready",
